{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_021mat01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_021mat01_title", "source_sha256": "7fdbc054c0b21af641f7f8f6076296a56277b1944a552b689dab078a259f6c5c", "ja": "まつりとおでかけ1", "zh": "和茉莉外出1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_021mat01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_021mat01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4e2fb1b93745d19a7d4fc848c8a223ac3d344897c7ab73531679ce5df9e16cc1", "ja": "まつりとおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和茉莉一起外出的场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_021mat01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_021mat01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6f6bb52567ad26b2a1e893bb5fe18e7ef865ec956980510821241e2e1fa83b55", "ja": "（佐賀のラジオ番組で、まつりがゲスト収録。\n地元の歴史について語るようだが……）", "zh": "（小祭在佐贺的广播节目中作为嘉宾录制节目。听说要聊聊当地的历史，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_021mat01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_021mat01_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "b35d460cefbea37e298bffdfed38ea919c3b1eccf2f58654bf2137d990ea159b", "ja": "まつりにおまかせなのです。姫は佐賀のお城について、\nしっかり予習をしてきたのですよ。", "zh": "包在茉莉身上吧。本公主可是好好做足了\n关于佐贺城堡的功课哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_021mat01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_021mat01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "114e50bad12b1b84d1272eb3138ab1dec60c3dc2217d91e0314aed8d5cebbed7", "ja": "おお。自信たっぷりだな、まつり。たしか佐賀城は\n肥前の佐賀藩の中心で、鍋島家が治めていたんだっけ。", "zh": "哦。还真是信心满满啊，茉莉。记得佐贺城曾是肥前佐贺藩的中心，由锅岛家统治，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_021mat01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_021mat01_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "e04797db50bff87cc07b247d400cf02cdc7385028e19b7e0fbdec366d7c5f110", "ja": "そうなのです。今のお城は建て直されたもので……\n遠い昔は、熊さんが住んでいたのです。", "zh": "没错。现在的城堡是重建的……\n在很久很久以前，那里住着熊熊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_021mat01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_021mat01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9fca63eb83412e6b526154b71ca8048ae3836806da10d1b56d4d31b5d675d11d", "ja": "えっ、熊？　城で熊を飼っていた……とか？", "zh": "诶，熊？是在城里养了熊……之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_021mat01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_021mat01_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "469453aec649a6b507621c82af0b490c4f14f4cd59154118477cccd5899efd72", "ja": "そうではなくて、熊さんがお城のあるじだったのです。\nとっても大きくて強い熊さんなのです。", "zh": "不是那样，熊先生才是城堡的主人。\n是一只非常高大强壮的熊先生哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_021mat01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_021mat01_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "c9c73a3a3fcfffc6b9c09f7d0c50699a29c8d8b8a20d69ebed85729eb04033d1", "ja": "熊さんの一族は、肥前の国を支配していました。\nけれどある日、肥前の熊さんは戦いに出かけたのです。", "zh": "熊先生一族曾统治着肥前国。\n可是有一天，肥前的熊先生出战去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_021mat01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_021mat01_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "511e9a117c69063e7fde413e088da29452bc32c87de7db95966506818b01588a", "ja": "熊さんは釣りの勝負に負け、家が滅びてしまい……跡を\n継いだのが江戸時代の佐賀藩の、鍋島さんなのです。", "zh": "熊先生输掉了钓鱼比赛，家族就此覆灭……接替其家业的，是江户时代佐贺藩的锅岛家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_021mat01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_021mat01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "fb1575f8f8a14cb8bcb1c7afe3774b68f0c7f36c0a10897ea62734a7cad1c703", "ja": "うん？　何か色々と端折られている気がするけど……\nつまり、城には長い戦いの歴史があるってことかな。", "zh": "嗯？总觉得有些地方被省略掉了……也就是说，这座城有着漫长的战斗历史吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_021mat01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_021mat01_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "1bc55d75d8e8ae0c1887fce4e01cc7e1dd7dc134c4bb8fc4baad3455fadee781", "ja": "そうなのです。熊さん以外に、化け猫と戦った言い伝え\nまであるのですよ。ふぁんたすてぃっく！なのです。", "zh": "就是这样。据说除了熊先生以外，还有和妖猫战斗过的传说呢。真是太棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_021mat01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_021mat01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "3621a2baeceb5fc9c040ce46df7475fa728b819de20a139f6566b7707036bfea", "ja": "え、ええ……？\n佐賀って、不思議な場所なんだな……。", "zh": "诶、诶诶……？\n佐贺还真是个不可思议的地方啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
